Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,The Guardian of the Rim
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, Tibbie volunteered to join the team,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but her skills didn’t meet the requirements.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie encouraged herself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to be as brave and strong as her favorite basketball player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,After rigorous training, she finally made the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a point guard, but where can they find a suitable center?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, come over and have some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:00:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Jonie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations to everyone for making the basketball team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I made some nutritious salads.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Senior Blazey, come and have some too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll just…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.56,0:01:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie is really like our guardian angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She has everything ready for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.44,0:01:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie, you should focus on your own things too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me feel a bit bad that you’re always looking after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I don’t really have anything else to do. If I did…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,cheering everyone on is exactly what I want to do most.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie is so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie, why don’t you play basketball too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, we could all play together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:01:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.20,0:02:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? I think I’ll pass…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.88,0:02:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t have much talent; I’ll just cheer you guys on from the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.32,0:02:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Big news! Really big news!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We just got notified that we need to show up with a full roster the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If we still can’t get enough team members,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the team will be disqualified from the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Disqualified?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,From the?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.52,0:02:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Game?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, we have a small forward, a power forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,a shooting guard, and a point guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we’re still missing…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A center.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can we find a center?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,For a genius like me, taking on multiple roles isn’t out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The center is the pivot of the team’s offense and defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They need not only great height and extraordinary strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:03:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but also the ability to secure the rebounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You could say they are the guardian of the rim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardian…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I switch to being the center?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The capable always have to shoulder the heavy lifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.32,0:03:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren’t tall enough for that position.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hold another open tryout
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,for the center position.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If even I don’t make the cut, who else could?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.88,0:03:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don’t be angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Their defensive strength isn’t up to par.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Their height and jumping ability aren’t good enough either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Registration is coming up soon—what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don’t have a suitable center,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,our team will have a fatal weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We won’t make it very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go look for other candidates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s…continue practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine…luckily you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But Jonie, you’re really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.16,0:06:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as everyone’s okay, that’s what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we can really find five suitable team members?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, gather ’round.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Still haven’t found the right candidates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, give me one more night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll definitely meet the standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up—that would still only make four members.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, there {\i1}is{\i0} a suitable candidate,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,with the right height and strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, just tell us who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The coach finally recognizes my talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of Jonie, she passed almost all the tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, why don’t you have a match with Jonie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Compete against Jonie? Is that really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You really want to be the center, don’t you? Give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.24,0:08:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry…I…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don’t know how to play basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s fine too. Come with me for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you what I’m made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This rebound is definitely mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So…so tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,During the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.48,0:09:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,your height can really help you grab the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When the ball is in the air,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just imagine you’re helping a kid retrieve a stuck kite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Helping a kid get a kite…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You just need to jump your hardest and use your height advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you’ll definitely be able to…grab the rebound.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to protecting the rim is to keep blocking your opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,just like protecting your friend from bumping into a ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you just need to do what you normally do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Protecting my friend from bumping into a ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Defensive foul by Jonie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Game over; let’s call this one a draw
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.60,0:10:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie, please lead us to victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I don’t think I really did anything
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just doing what I normally do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re that good even when just playing casually…I’m so envious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie, why don’t you join the team too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, the five of us can be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Jonie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.80,0:11:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Always guarding behind your teammates,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,protecting our rim at all costs—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,that is the guardian of the rim.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a very important position.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Guarding…everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m willing to give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Little Goat: one, two, three, four, five!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. Good luck in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, come over for a photo after you’ve signed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one—say cheese!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
